515
00:14:47.820 --> 00:14:48.960
Com o arquivo em dia,

516
00:14:48.960 --> 00:14:50.940
a prova sai com doze.

517
00:14:50.940 --> 00:14:53.183
Então o ls confere se o caminho

518
00:14:53.183 --> 00:14:55.143
